...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

사용자: 사용자 { class: person }
ui: Streamlit UI { class: ours }
assessment_agent: Assessment 에이전트 { class: ours }
action_agent: Action 에이전트 { class: ours }
followup_agent: Follow-up 에이전트 { class: ours }
gpt4o: GPT-4o { class: ext }

사용자 -> ui: 버튼 클릭
ui -> assessment_agent: initiate_swarm_chat(task)
assessment_agent -> gpt4o: 요약 강제 프롬프트 + task
gpt4o -> assessment_agent: update_assessment_overview 호출
assessment_agent -> action_agent: SwarmResult→action_agent
action_agent -> gpt4o: 요약 강제 + 누적요약
gpt4o -> action_agent: update_action_overview 호출
action_agent -> followup_agent: SwarmResult(agent=followup_agent, context_variables) 이관
followup_agent -> gpt4o: 요약 강제 프롬프트
gpt4o -> followup_agent: update_followup_overview 호출
followup_agent -> assessment_agent: SwarmResult→assessment_agent
